ations, and MRI imaging. Named after French mathematician X who studied heat conduction and showed that almost any function could be expressed as a trigonometric series, it is called the X Transform. ID X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:11:55Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Fourier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:11:56Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Fourier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:11:57Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Fourier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:11:57Z", "username": "Sayu Sekhar", "text": "fourier ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:11:57Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Fourier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:12:02Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Fourier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-14T05:12:09Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "POINTS MIL GAYE POINTS MIL GAYE", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]